{"seconds": 33.5, "exit": 0, "final": "Fantastic! The best move is **Qxc3+** and it's winning in all variations:\n- If **Rc2**, then **Qxc2#** is mate\n- If **bxc3**, then **Rb1#** is mate\n\n**Best move:** Qxc3+\n\n**Main line:** Qxc3+ Rc2 Qxc2#\n\n**Motif:** capturingDefender, pin\n\n**Coaching Note:**\n\nThe pinned knight on c3 is the key. Since it can't move without exposing the king to check, it can't defend itself. By capturing it with check (**Qxc3+**), you force the rook to interpose, but then **Qxc2** is checkmate. If White blocks with the b-pawn instead, **Rb1** is mate. Look for pinned pieces\u2014they're often fatally weak defenders.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qxc3+\", \"line\": [\"Qxc3+\", \"Rc2\", \"Qxc2#\"], \"motifs\": [\"pin\", \"capturingDefender\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Qe2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Qd4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Rb1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Rd7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Qc1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Qd3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/1rp4n/6pk/p2Q1b1p/2q4P/2N1PpP1/PP1R1P2/2KR4 b - - 3 31", "move": "Qxc3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect